    {
      "claim_type": "module_role",
      "scope": {
        "type": "module",
        "module": "flash_state"
      },
      "summary": "flash_state 是 SPI 闪存协议的状态机控制器，负责管理 SPI 主设备与外部闪存之间的读写操作序列。",
      "subject": "flash_state",
      "explanation": "该模块通过实例化 spi_master_spi0 并连接控制信号（如 i_ctl、i_readflag、i_w_en）和数据信号（i_data2spi、o_dataFspi），实现闪存访问的状态转换。assign 依赖显示状态机状态（r_state）和启动信号（i_startRead、r_start_spi）控制 SPI 使能（w_spi_en），输出 o_finish 由 SPI 片选信号（w_spi_cs_n）驱动，表明操作完成。",
      "signals": [
        "i_ctl",
        "i_data2spi",
        "o_dataFspi",
        "i_readflag",
        "i_w_en",
        "o_finish"
      ],
      "instances": [
        "u_spi_master"
      ],
      "doc_priority": "primary",
      "requires_rtl_source_review": true,
      "confidence": "medium",
      "evidence": [
